<div
    id='modal-pagar-nomina'
    class='fixed top-0 left-0 h-screen w-full bg-black/50 z-20 content-center hidden'
    inert
>
    <form
        id='form-pagar-nomina'
        data-ignore
        class='bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg max-w-lg m-auto overflow-auto max-h-[100vh] relative'
    >
        <div
            role='heading'
            class='w-full flex justify-between items-center px-6 py-4 border-b border-gray-200 sticky top-0 bg-white z-10'
        >
            <h2 class='text-xl font-medium text-gray-900'>Pagar Nómina</h2>
            <button
                type='button'
                data-dismiss='modal'
                data-ico='cancel'
                class='material-symbols-rounded cursor-pointer flex hover:text-red-500'
            ></button>
        </div>
        <div role='dialog' class='p-6 space-y-4'>
            <div class='bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-sm text-blue-800'>
                <p class='font-medium mb-1'>Información de la nómina:</p>
                <ul class='text-xs space-y-1'>
                    <li class='flex items-center justify-between'>
                        <span class='font-semibold'>Período:</span>
                        <span data-nomina-periodo>—</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class='flex items-center justify-between'>
                        <span class='font-semibold'>Total (Bs.):</span>
                        <span data-nomina-total>—</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class='flex items-center justify-between'>
                        <span class='font-semibold'>Pagado (Bs.):</span>
                        <span data-nomina-pagado>—</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class='flex items-center justify-between'>
                        <span class='font-semibold'>Pendiente (Bs.):</span>
                        <span data-nomina-pendiente>—</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <input type='hidden' name='nomina_id' />

            <div class='w-full'>
                <label
                    for='monto_pagar_nomina'
                    class='block mb-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 text-start'
                >
                    Monto a pagar (Bs.)
                </label>
                <input
                    type='text'
                    name='monto'
                    id='monto_pagar_nomina'
                    data-valid='float'
                    class='w-full bg-red-100/50 border border-gray-300 text-gray-900 text-sm rounded-lg focus:ring-red-400 focus:border-red-400 p-2 outline-none'
                    placeholder='0,00'
                    value='0,00'
                    required
                />
            </div>

            <div class='w-full'>
                <label for='medio_pago_nomina' class='block mb-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 text-start'>
                    Tipo de pago
                </label>
                <select
                    name='medio_pago'
                    id='medio_pago_nomina'
                    class='w-full bg-red-100/50 border border-gray-300 text-gray-900 text-sm rounded-lg p-2 outline-none'
                    required
                >
                    <option value='efectivo'>Efectivo</option>
                    <option value='digital'>Transferencia / Pago móvil</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div id='datos-pago-digital-nomina' class='hidden space-y-4'>
                <div>
                    <label for='referencia_pago_nomina' class='block mb-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 text-start'>
                        Referencia
                    </label>
                    <input
                        type='text'
                        name='referencia'
                        id='referencia_pago_nomina'
                        maxlength='120'
                        class='w-full bg-red-100/50 border border-gray-300 text-gray-900 text-sm rounded-lg p-2 outline-none'
                        placeholder='Número de referencia'
                    />
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label for='cuenta_receptora_nomina' class='block mb-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 text-start'>
                        Cuenta receptora
                    </label>
                    <input
                        type='text'
                        name='cuenta_receptora'
                        id='cuenta_receptora_nomina'
                        maxlength='160'
                        class='w-full bg-red-100/50 border border-gray-300 text-gray-900 text-sm rounded-lg p-2 outline-none'
                        placeholder='Banco / teléfono Pago móvil'
                    />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class='bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-lg p-3'>
                <div class='text-sm text-yellow-800'>
                    <p class='font-medium mb-1'>Información Importante:</p>
                    <ul class='text-xs space-y-1'>
                        <li>El pago se registra como un egreso en bolívares de tu caja abierta.</li>
                        <li>Debes tener una caja abierta para poder pagar la nómina.</li>
                        <li>Si el monto es menor al pendiente, la nómina queda como pago parcial.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div role='doc-footnote' class='px-6 py-2 border-t border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-end gap-4'>
            <button
                data-dismiss='modal'
                type='button'
                class='inline-block bg-transparent text-gray-500 px-4 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-400/50 border border-gray-400 cursor-pointer'
            >
                Cancelar
            </button>
            <button
                type='submit'
                class='inline-block bg-pink-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-pink-600 cursor-pointer'
            >
                Confirmar Pago
            </button>
        </div>
    </form>
</div>
